        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.26.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ist 26:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PHP.3.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Plp 3:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nyini kinkïtï Paulö lö, Sadukaytin* walaka kï Parisaytin* walaka ompö pïchoni, kïngölonchï Kokwö ompö kut nyo wow lö, “Tupchenichu. Ochan Parisayon, nyo le wero Parisaytin. Kakirwokwanïn ompö yi ompöwölo okönan lö, tutu asïyech pich cho kikïmeghö.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kiwang kïmwa lenyoni, kutor kïsyal Parisaytin nko Sadukaytin, akïpesyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.12.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mrk 12:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ompöwölo lentöy Sadukaytin metutucha pich akï puryö malayken anta oy. Wölo ghönöy Parisaytin choni löwïr kï sömök. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtasa syalanay kïyetï, kïnget koneti kirurut walaka cho pö okumpö Parisaytin kughyö akïghetisyö lö, “Möminye kïgh nyo kalel chichï manan köngölonchï nyinte mïkulögh anta malaykayan köny?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwowit kimölötonay tya ntökuwöghisyö yetïnay lö, töptoy pöröy tuyononi Paulö. Kïlenyona, kïmwochï askarinechi lö, oröytenö ape amïtuna Paulö, kungwïna kwenungwa, amït nyinte kïwö kö pö soch.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kughyongö Echotyon oghononi ato kilekïto Paulö akïlenchï, “Inyakanitï! Ompöwölo kïle wölo kesöwintönchaninyi ompö yi le Yerusalem, kïmïchini söwintönchaninyi lenyoni ompö Rumi tïkwïl.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Söpchini pipö Yaudi Paulö tökïpar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtuyö pipö Yaudi walaka ompö asis nyo kirïptoy akuwalwal kegh ompö tawu Tororöt lö, “Mökyomisïyechanye anta kïgheghsyö tökïtenö ketïghöcha Paulö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitïlöy, tömönut angwan pïchoni kituyö akitat ngalechoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otolapay kïpa wölo mi tïsï cho echön nko poy akïlenchï, “Kakewawalacha kegh löwïr lö mökyomechanye kïgh nyonikïny tökïtenö keparacha Paulö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona ye mwochinö nyo le nyi nko pipö Kokwö atetepa yetïnay kumïtï kungwïn wölo omitekwa aghakwa kegh le ato oyörekwa okïte lasiny ngale walaka ompö nyinte. Wölo kïmicha nyu atoni kïpsach keköngöy nyinte atökepara kïtomö kïrikï wölo omitekwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kïlïm karöchïnin nyo le mamato Paulö ngalechoni mwoghöy, kïlenyona kurïp kutang kö pö soch akïmwochï Paulö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïkur Paulö wöwïn pö askarin akïlenchï, “Mïte karachïnintonï kïwö wölo mi pöytoghintö nyo wow, tïng ngölyon nyo yöröy kïmwochini nyinte.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumït yetïnay weray kïwö wölo mi yetïnay wow akïlenchï, “Kökuranïn chichay ratate le Paulö akïlenchanïn mïta karachïnintonï wölo imitenyi ompöwölo tïng ngölyon nyo yöröy kïmwowunyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïnam yetïnay karachïnintonay egh akumït ato le yona, akïlenchï, “Ne ngölyonte nyini imökenyi mwowanïn nya?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï, “Köchomnyechï wowïntino pipö Yaudi lö pkonöy kïtepïnyi asïyech kemït Paulö tawu Kokwö le nyo kötomököy Kokwö kïtepo nyinte ngale walaka lasiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo meterchï chane, ompöwölo mi pich cho tïlöy tömönut angwan cho ghïpchot kusyepöy nyinte. Kikuwalwal kegh chane lö momisïyicha anta gheghsyö tökïtenö kepar Paulö. Mi chane ye kïpsach tökwigh ngölyontononi, akïmi kïköngöy ngölyon nyo ngwïno wölo imitenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï yetïnay wow karachïnintonay, “Memwochï chi ompö akonga lö, kemwowaninyi ngalechï. Atolapay kïlenchï, ‘Wïyö.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kakiyok Paulö kïwö Kaysaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kikur yetïnay wow yetïntin odeny cho rïpöy nyinte akïlenchï, “Akanya kïnap kegh askarin cho le 200 atökïpa kutang Kaysaria nko walaka 70 cho pegho angoletin nko 200 cho pö ngötwö, anap kegh atangeta satïn sömök nyo pö soya oghö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïmwochï kïyörchï Paulö angoletin cho kiwegho, atökemït nyinte kwit wölo mi pöytoghinto Peliki nyo karam.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kukirchï pöytoghintonay wow palalyan kïlö,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Takwes, we pöytoghin Peliki nyo konyïtote, ani Klaudio Lisia nyo kakir palayantanï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinam pipö Yaudi chichï, akilekït kïpar chane nyinte. Onkïtwan lö chi pö Rumi nyinte, kïlenyona owan nko askarin osörï nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyomökan nyu onkïtune lö ne nyo kirwokyineghö chane nyinte, kïlenyona amïtan kïwö Kokwengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpköchanïn nyu lö kitöpö kokwe kimölöto kirurutkökwa walaka kimasïwanye kïgh nyo kimïchini chichï kepar anta kerat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kemwowanïn lö mi pipö Yaudi walaka kusyepöy nyinte, cho kimököy kïpar, amutan lö nya oyokwan nyinte kungwïn wölo imitenyi. Kyomwochan pich cho kirwokini nyinte kwipï kirwokengwa wölo imitenyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumït nyu askarin Paulö kïle wölini kikiyomïstö. Kïyotï Paulö akumït oghononi kïwö Antipatris. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany kïyech, kïmïlisyö kö pö soch askarinechay kipegho kelyön, kïpïstö chay pö angoletin kïpa nko nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumït kïwö Kaysaria, akutö pöytoghintonay palalyante, akwonkoghchï nyinte Paulö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusomön nyu pöytoghintonay palalyantanay atolapay kïtepa Paulö kore wölo kingwïno. Nyini kinkïtï lö ki chi pö Kilikia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïlenchï, “Oteran ngaleku asïyech atonkïtwan kini keghanyi otini ketï pïchoni kirwokunyi.” Atolapay kïmwatïta keripö Paulö kö pö Erode nyo pö kirwok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kirwokyini Paulö ompö tawu pöytoghin Peliki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
